Package: scratch-subdir
Version: 1.0.0
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NS3-Project Packager <noreply@example.com>
Depends: bash, libns3-dev, pkg-config
Description: Packaged ns-3 source launcher for scratch-subdir
 This package contains the ns-3 source file scratch/subdir/scratch-subdir.cc and any local project
 files it includes. The installed launcher compiles only those files, not the
 entire upstream ns-3 tree, and relies on apt-installable ns-3 development
 libraries from the distribution.
